  "title": "Merge Sorted Array",
  "summary": "Given two sorted integer arrays nums1 and nums2, along with their lengths m and n, merge nums1 and nums2 into a single sorted array within nums1.",
  "statement": "Given two sorted integer arrays nums1 and nums2, along with their lengths m and n, merge nums1 and nums2 into a single sorted array within nums1. The first m elements of nums1 are the initial elements to merge, followed by n zeros to be ignored. nums2 contains n elements to merge into nums1.",
  "constraints": [
    "0<=m,n and 1<=m+n<=200. nums1 has length m+n; its first m entries and all n entries of nums2 are independently sorted.",
